{"slug":"porn-company-bang-bros-reacts-to-mavs-forwards-dorian-finney-smith-reggie-bullocks-new-nickname-selection","postId":74591,"title":"Porn Company Bang Bros Reacts To Mavs' Forwards Dorian Finney Smith & Reggie Bullock's New Nickname Selection","htmlContent":"<!-- wp:image {\"id\":516066,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/GetPaidStock.com-6292efd96e051.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-516066\"/><figcaption>Getty Images</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Last week, the Golden State Warriors eliminated the Dallas Mavericks to conduct their annual exit interviews. Before Reggie Bullock and Dorian Finney Smith started answering questions from the media, Smith coined the two of them 'The Bang Bros.\" </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>“I thought it was going to move a little faster, you know, Bang Bros… The Bang Bros,\" <a href=\"https://landonbuford.com/2022/05/28/mavs-forwards-reggie-bullock-and-dorian-finney-smith-nicknamed-themselves-the-bang-bros-during-mavs-exit-interview-watch/\">Said Smith</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/LandonBuford/status/1530291870126985216?s=20u0026t=zbInDUFdmK_dKGw-r4_XuA\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"twitter\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://twitter.com/LandonBuford/status/1530291870126985216?s=20&amp;t=zbInDUFdmK_dKGw-r4_XuA\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Bally Sports' Brandon 'Scoop B' Robinson tweeted, \"Collaboration with BangBros.com in the near future for Dorian Finney Smith and Reggie Bullock apparently.\"</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The porn company caught wind of the video and Robinson's tweet <a href=\"https://twitter.com/BangBrosDotCom1/status/1530750850565656581?s=20&amp;t=HaNBWbV4Q-b2uC8vOOkvrg\">and replied</a>, \"Sounds like plan 100 percent.\"</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/BangBrosDotCom1/status/1530750850565656581?s=20u0026t=HaNBWbV4Q-b2uC8vOOkvrg\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"twitter\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://twitter.com/BangBrosDotCom1/status/1530750850565656581?s=20&amp;t=HaNBWbV4Q-b2uC8vOOkvrg\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This past season for the Dallas Mavericks, Dorian Finney Smith averaged 11 points, 4.7 rebounds, and 1.7 assists per game in 80 games this season. Meanwhile, Bullock averaged 8.6 points, 3.5 rebounds, and 1.2 assists per game in 68 games this season for the Mavericks. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>After trading Kristaps Porzingis&nbsp;and a second-round pick to the&nbsp;Washington Wizards&nbsp;for Spencer Dinwiddie&nbsp;and Davis Bertans at the trade deadline, The Dallas Mavericks gave Dorian Finney Smith a four year extension worth $52 million, according to <a href=\"https://twitter.com/ShamsCharania/status/1491890094764175361?s=20&amp;t=wKSqZXX7euG_Q1OIrXUASw\">Shams Charania of The Athletic</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/ShamsCharania/status/1491890094764175361?s=20u0026t=wKSqZXX7euG_Q1OIrXUASw\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"twitter\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://twitter.com/ShamsCharania/status/1491890094764175361?s=20&amp;t=wKSqZXX7euG_Q1OIrXUASw\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The Mavericks are now preparing for next month's draft. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->","excerpt":"Getty Images Last week, the Golden State Warriors eliminated the Dallas Mavericks to conduct their annual exit interviews. Before Reggie Bullock and Dorian Finney Smith started answering questions…","publishedAt":"2022-05-29T05:00:00Z","modifiedAt":"2022-05-29T05:00:00Z","author":{"slug":"chad-hughes","displayName":"Chad Hughes"},"categories":[{"slug":"sports","name":"Sports"}],"tags":[{"slug":"bang-bros","name":"Bang Bros"},{"slug":"brandon-scoopb-robinson","name":"Brandon 'ScoopB' Robinson"},{"slug":"dallas-mavericks","name":"Dallas Mavericks"},{"slug":"dorian-finney-smith","name":"Dorian Finney-Smith"},{"slug":"landon-buford","name":"Landon Buford"},{"slug":"nba-draft","name":"NBA Draft"},{"slug":"reggie-bullock","name":"Reggie Bullock"}],"heroImage":{"originalUrl":"http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/GetPaidStock.com-6292efd96e051.jpg"},"inlineImageUrls":["http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/GetPaidStock.com-6292efd96e051.jpg"],"readingTimeMin":1,"type":"post","link":"https://landonbuford.com/porn-company-bang-bros-reacts-to-mavs-forwards-dorian-finney-smith-reggie-bullocks-new-nickname-selection/"}